<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">Vidunda Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Ugubulo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ugubulo woyapeligwe Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ugubulo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ugub</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ugubulo</para>
  <para style="mt2">woyapeligwe Yohana</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Ugubulo ndo chitabu cha kuduma kuli Ilagano lya Sambi. Nachali chitabu cha kuduma kuli kwandichigwa na mtumigwa Yohana kuli mhela wa makumi tisa na gahano (95) kulawa Yesu loyavumbuche (Ugubulo 1:1). Kahi nakandika Mbuli Inojile yandichigwe na Yohana na baluwa zidatu, nazo ndo 1 Yohana na 2 Yohana na 3 Yohana. Yohana nakazeleka kota yumwe nayaganigwe na Yesu (Yohana 13:23). Heye nakandika chitabu cha Ugubulo mhela naloyali kuli Chihilwa cha Patimo kwa chiwalo cha kuhindigwa nachali kudamla Mbuli Inojile ya Yesu Kilistu (Ugubulo 1:9).</para>
  <para style="ip">Chiwalo cha Yohana kwandika chitabu cha Ugubulo chali kuwakangaza nhumbula walingusoma weme nzinzili kuli makundo kwa Yesu na kuwegalila utumbilo kwa vila mhela wa kuhiluka kwa Yesu Kilistu wa habehi (Ugubulo 1:3, 22:7). Nakandika kwa wanhu weng'ha walingumkunda Kilistu ila kavichema ng'hatu vilundo saba vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu kuli sula ya keli mbaka ya kadatu (2-3). Yohana yuye kangulonga kota choyandiche ndo uloli (Ugubulo 1:3), na kulajila misisila minji kuli chitabu cheng'ha, kota kanguvyona kwa meho. Chitabu achi chifanda honhu hanji kuli Ilagano lya Katali kota vila chitabu cha Sekaliya 6:1-8. Mhalamhanda saba na visaye saba kahi vifanda kota nongwa zoyegale Nguluwi kuwagaza Wamisili (Kulawa 7-9). Chitabu cha Ugubulo changulonga mbuli ya mhela wa kuduma, vila Yesu vyoyowa yasumile na weng'ha womkunda heye, wowa na ukomu wa mazuwa gose hamwe na heye. Chikundize chitabu achi chikukanye hegwe na chikugalile utumbilo kwa vila kuhiluka kahi kwa Yesu Kilistu kwa habehi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io">1. Yohana kangwaluka kwa kilonjela yuye ka whaani na ndaze vyoyaubochele ugubulo wa uloli awu kulawa kwa Yesu (Ugubulo 1:1-1:20).</para>
  <para style="io">2. Kanguhilika usenga kwa vilundo saba vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu (Ugubulo 1:1-3:22).</para>
  <para style="io">3. Kangutang'hula mbuli ilinguwala mihuli saba (Ugubulo 4:1-8:5) na mhalamhanda saba (Ugubulo 8:6-11:19).</para>
  <para style="io">4. Kulawa aga, Yohana kangusima ngondo ya mwana msongolo na izoka likulu liwele na mitwi saba (Ugubulo 12:1-14:20).</para>
  <para style="io">5. Kahi kangwandika mbuli ya visaye saba vimemile kuzudila kwa Nguluwi (Ugubulo 15:1-16:18).</para>
  <para style="io">6. Kahi Yohana kangusima vila Nguluwi vyoyawasumile wang'honyo wa heye kilanga (Ugubulo 17:1-20:15).</para>
  <para style="io">7. Kahi Yohana kangusima mbuli ya kilanga kunyale na isi inyale ikuya mhela wa kuduma (Ugubulo 21:1-22:21).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Awu ndo ugubulo yaulavile Yesu Kilistu, yapegwe na Nguluwi leka yawalajile vitumagwa wa heye mbuli ilingulapa kulawa habehi. Kilistu nakamlajiza mhilisi wa kilanga yamlonjele chitumagwa wa heye Yohana mbuli ayo. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Naye Yohani nakasimila geng'ha goyawene, gawele ndo ulonzi wa Nguluwi na vinhu vyeng'ha Yesu Kilistu vyoyalonjile na kudita. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Kabweda heye munhu yawele ngusoma chitabu achi chiwele na usenga wa chiuloli na wabweda hewo wawelenguhulika na kuhulichiza gandichigwe mchitabu achi, mina mhela wa mbuli ayi wahabehi.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulamso kwa vilundo saba vya wanhu walingumkunda Yesu Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Heni Yohana ndanguwandichila vilundo saba vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu viwele mkowa wa Asiya. Ndanguwaganilani isungu lya Nguluwi na kikala goya kulawa kwa heye yawele baho na yalinguya, kulawa kwa muhe saba wawele hali chigoda cha heye cha undewa <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />na kulawa kwa Yesu Kilistu, mlolezi wa kukundigwa, wa mwaluko kuzilipuligwa kulawa kuli kubagama, yawele chilongozi wa wandewa wa isi. Heye kangutugana na kwa danda ya heye ibohoche mumsalaba, katudita twilejehe kulawa kuli gehile ga hetwe, <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />nakatudita hetwe tuwe undewa wa watambika, tumditile mijito Nguluwi, Mhaza wa heye. Kwa heye Yesu Kilistu gawe ukulu na ludali, mazuwa gose! Ena.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Mwela yoo! Kanguya na ng'hungugu! Chila munhu komona, na wala wamhomile. Nhanzi zeng'ha muisi zolombocheza kwa chiwalo cha heye. Ahi ndo vyoiwa, Ena.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />“Heni nda mwaluko na kuduma kwa chila chinhu,” Kangulonga Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali, nayawele baho yawele aha na yalinguya.<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulota kwa Mwana wa munhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Heni nda Yohana, mng'holozenu, kwa nzila ya kilumba na Yesu, nda hamwe na hemwe kuli kugazigwa kuli undewa wa heye na kwimilila ng'hatu. Heni nanyilikwa kuli chihilwa chiwelenguchemigwa Patimo kwa chiwalo cha kudamla ulonzi wa Nguluwi na kula kukomya koyagubule Yesu. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Lelo, kuli zuwa lya Mkulu, namemezwa na Muhe Yelile, nanyulika kumbele kwa heni lizi ling'angala kota lizi lya mhalamhanda. <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />Alyo lizi nalilonga, “Wandiche kuli chitabu gala gouwele ngugona, uchihiliche kuli vilundo saba vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu, yani Efeso na Simulina na Peligamoni na Suatila na Salide na Filadelifiya na Laudikeya.”<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Lelo, nanyinduka ndimone ayo yalonjile na heni, nambona vinhu saba vya zahabu vya kuwichila chenje <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />na hagati ha vinhu saba vya zahabu vya kuwichila chenje nakwali na yumwe yafandile kota Mwana wa munhu, naye nayali yavalile ikanzu lilefu na isali lya zahabu mmhambaga. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Mnvili za heye nazali nzelu chweya kota sufi, kota seluji na meho ga heye nagali kota ilapi lya chenje, <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />magulu ga heye nagali kota shaba ihovujigwe kuli mfuo wa chiluli na lizi lya heye lyali kota lizi lya kubogoma kwa mazi. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Kuli moko wa heye wa kudilo nayali yebate nhondwe saba na kumlomo kwa heye nakulawa ipanga liwele na ukali unoligwe kweng'ha kwili. Chihanga cha heye naching'hala ng'hatu kota isanya lya nemisi.<verse eid="REV 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Lelo, vyondimuwene hela, nanyigwa hali magulu ga heye kota mtufi. Ila heye nakawika moko wa heye wa kudilo mchanya mwa heni, nakalonga, “Uleche kudumba! Heni ndo wa mwaluko na wa kuduma. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Heni ndo yuye yawele mkomu! Nandali mbagame, ila, ulole, sambi ndamkomu mazuwa gose. Ndanalo ludali lwa kubagama na kuli isi ya wabagame. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Lelo, sambi wandiche mbuli ayi youiwene, mbuli iwelengulawila sambi na gala golawila hamba. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Uviso wa nhondwe zila saba zouziwene kuli moko wa heni wa kudilo na uviso wa vila vinhu saba vya zahabu vya kuwichila chenje ndo awu. Zila nhondwe saba ndo wahilisi wa kilanga wa vilundo vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu na vila vinhu saba vya zahabu vya kuwichila chenje, ndo vilundo saba vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu.<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s">Usenga kwa chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu ako Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />“Kwa mhilisi wa kilanga wa chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu wa ako Efeso wandiche ahi. Awu ndo usenga ulawile kwa heye yalingibata zila nhondwe saba kuli moko wa heye wa kudilo na yalingujenda hagati ha vinhu saba vya zahabu vya kuwichila chenje. <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Ndigazela madito ga hegwe geng'ha, kikangaza kwa hegwe na kwimilila kwa hegwe. Ndivizela kota hambe uwemilile wanhu wehile, kahi kuwajeza wala walingichema watumigwa, nawo hebu, nakuvizela kota wadesi. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Hegwe nawali ubeteza na kwimilila magazo kwa chiwalo cha itagwa lya heni, hutochile hebu. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Ila ndanayo mbuli imwe hela kwa hegwe, sambi hegwe hulingungana kahi kota aho mwaluko. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Lelo, ukumbuche hala nakougwile! Umgalamchile Nguluwi na kudita kota vyouditile hala mwaluko. Ila wone huditile ahyo, ndanguya kwa hegwe na kuchusa chinhu cha hegwe cha zahabu cha kuwichila chenje. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Ila ndangukutogola kwa chinhu chimwe. Hegwe kwangugazudila madito ga Wanikolayi, kota nani vyondilingugazudila.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />“Yawele na makutu, yahuliche gala Muhe wa Nguluwi yalinguwalonjela vilundo vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:7">“Yasindile ndomkundiza kulya mafuza ga igodi lya ukomu liwele kuli kagunda ka Nguluwi.<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga kwa chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu ako Simulina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />“Kwa mhilisi wa kilanga wa chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu ako Simulina wandiche ahi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:8">“Awu ndo usenga ulingulawa kwa heye yawele ndo wa mwaluko na wa kuduma, nayawele yabagame na sambi kamkomu. <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Ndivizela kugazigwa kwa hegwe, ndivizela kahi uzunwa wa hegwe, hanga kwa kukomya, hegwe ndo uwele na lufufu! Ndivizela kuliga kowakulijile wala wawelengichema wawo ndo Wayahudi ila hawawele Wayahudi wakukomya, ila ndo chilundo cha Limazoga. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Uleche kudumba ne hado, gala gawele kukulapa kugazigwa. Uhulichize! Mwihe kangugana kuwajeza kwa kuwachema wamwe wa hemwe mchinweng'ho, namwe mowa na magazo kwa mhela wa mazuwa kumi. Muwe wanhu wakukundigwa mbaka kubagama, nani ndowapani itaji lya ukomu.<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />“Yawele na makutu, lelo, nayahuliche gala Muhe wa Nguluwi yalinguvilonjela vilundo vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:11">“Heye yasindile holumizwa na kubagama lwa keli.<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga kwa chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu ako Peligamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />“Kwa mhilisi wa kilanga wa chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu ako Peligamoni wandiche ahi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:12">“Awu ndo usenga ulingulawa kwa heye yawele na alyo ipanga likali mmoko linoleche kweng'ha kwili. <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Ndivizela koulingikala, hegwe kwangikala honhu hala hawele na chigoda cha undewa cha Limazoga! Nagwe ung'hali uchibatilila itagwa lya heni, hulemile makundo ga hegwe kwa heni, hanga mhela wula wa Antipasi mlolezi wa heni, mbele ndichitumbila, loyakopoligwe hala lilingikala Limazoga. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Ila ndanawo ulonzi udo kwa chiwalo cha hegwe. Kwa vila kwanawo ako wanhu wamwe walingibata malanguso ga Balaamu, heye yamlanguse Balaki yawawichile ngwamo Waisilaeli, leka walye vinhu vilavigwe nhambiko kwa jimalukolo na kudita ung'hondwa. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Hihyo du, hegwe nagwe kwanawo wanhu wamwe walingibata malanguso ga Wanikolayi. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Lelo, umgalamchile Nguluwi. Wone humgalamchile Nguluwi, ndanguya kwa hegwe ne kukawila, heni ndodita ngondo kwa hewo kwa alyo ipanga lilingulawa kuli mlomo wa heni. <verse eid="REV 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />Heye yawele na makutu, yahuliche ulonzi awu uwele Muhe Yelile yalinguwalonjela vilundo vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:17">“Yasindile ndomha chila chilyo chivisigwe chilinguchemigwa mana. Ndomha kahi iganga izelu lyandichigwe itagwa lya sambi liwele kuduhuli munhu yalizelele itagwa alyo ila wala wawele ngulibochela.<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga kwa chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu ako Tuatila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />“Kwa mhilisi wa kilanga wa chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu ako Tuatila wandiche ahi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:18">“Awu ndo Usenga wa Mwana wa Nguluwi, yawele na meho galingumwemwesa kota ilapi lya chiluli na magulu ga heye gangung'hala kota shaba ihovujigwe. <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Ndizizela mbuli za hegwe zeng'ha. Ndilizela igano na makundo na vyoulinguwatanza wayago na kwimilila kwa hegwe. Mhela awu hegwe kwangudita goya ng'hatu kusinda hala mwaluko. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Ila ndina mbuli imwe kwa hegwe ya kukukanya, kwangumwimilila yula mdala Yesebeli yawelengichema mloli, yawelenguwajiliza na kuwahada vitumagwa wa heni wadite ung'hondwa na kulya vinhu vitambichilwe jimalukolo. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Nani ndimha mhumhu yamgalamchile Nguluwi, ila kangulema kuleka ung'hondwa wa heye. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Uhulichize! Sambi ndomgaza kwa kumigalila matamwa na awo walingudita ung'hondwa hamwe na heye, wofichigwa na magazo makulu wone hawamgalamchile Nguluwi kwa madito ga hewo gehile gowaditile hamwe na heye. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Ndowakopola walingumuwinza na vilundo vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu vyeng'ha, izeleche kota heni ndo ndilinguvizela majesa gawo na nhumbula za hewo. Nani ndompa chila yumwe wa hemwe kota vyogawele madito ga heye.<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />“Ila ndanguwalonjela hemwe wanji muwele ako Tuatila, woneche weng'ha hawawele na malanguso ago, wohawavizelele chila chilinguchemigwa uviso wa Limazoga, kota vila vyowalingulonga, siwapani itunyo linji. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Mibatilile ng'hatu chomlangusigwe, mbaka hondikuya.<verse eid="REV 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />“Naye yasindile na yawelenguhulichiza na kulutilila kudita mbuli yombele ngugana mpaka kuduma, ndompa ludali lwa kulongoza wanhu wa nhanzi zeng'ha, <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />naye kowadima kwa ng'hweku ya chuma na kuwabenanga vihande vihande kota vinhu vya ilongo, kota vila heni vyombochele ludali kulawa kwa Mhaza wa heni. <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />Kopegwa ludali lulula lombochele kulawa kwa Mhaza wa heni. Nani ndomha ludali alo, kahi ndomha nhondwe ya lufuku.<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />“Yawele na makutu, yahuliche ulonzi awu, Muhe wa Nguluwi yalinguvilonjela vilundo vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu!<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Usenga kwa vilundo vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu ako Salide</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />“Kwa mhilisi wa kilanga wa chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu cha Salide wandiche ahi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">“Awu ndo usenga ulingulawa kwa yula yawele na muhe saba wa Nguluwi na nhondwe saba, ndangulonga ahi, ndizizela mbuli za hegwe zeng'ha, kwanguvizela kota kwa mkomu, aku ubagame! <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Uwe munhu wa kikala meho, ukakangaze mbuli ziponile, zilingugana kubagama. Mina, sonile madito ga hegwe kota genela hali Nguluwi wa heni. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Ukumbuche vila navyoubochele na vila navyouhuliche, uhulichize ago na umgalamchile Nguluwi. Wone hauwasile meho, ndokuya kota mhizi hegwe ne kuvizela hondikuya. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Ila wakuko wanhu wachefu ako Salide, wanhu wohawawichile nguwo za hewo wavu. Awo woluta hamwe na heni aku wavalile nguwo nzelu, kwa vila woneka wanguganigwa kuvala ahyo. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Heye yasindile kovalizwa ahyo, kwa nguwo nzelu. Nani sikusa itagwa lyake kulawa kuli chitabu cha ukomu, kahi ndolonga kwa mlomo wa heni, kota ndo wa heni hali Mhaza wa heni na hali mhilisi wa kilanga. <verse eid="REV 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Yawele na makutu, lelo, nayagahuliche gala Muhe wa Nguluwi vyoyalinguvilonjela vilundo vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu.<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga kwa vilundo vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu ako Filadelifiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />“Kwa mhilisi wa kilanga wa chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu cha Filadelifiya wandiche ahi!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:7">“Awu ndo usenga kulawa kwa heye yawele yelile na yawele wa kukomya na yawele na chichumulilo cha Daudi. Heye yalinguchumula kuduhu yoweza kuhinda, naye yalinguhinda kuduhu munhu yoweza kuchumula. <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />Ndizizela mbuli za hegwe zeng'ha! Gwela yoo, ndikupa chihindilo chichumuligwe kumwando kwa hegwe, uwele kuduhu munhu yoweza kuuhinda, ndivizela kota hegwe kuna mong'ho udo, ila kuhulichiza ulonzi wa heni, nahulibelile itagwa lya heni. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Uhulichize, ndangukupa wanhu wawele wa chilundo cha Limazoga, walingulonga hewo ndo Wayahudi, nawo hebu, ila wangulonga udesi. Ena, ndowadita woye kufugama hali magulu ga hegwe na kuvizela kota ndikugana. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Kwa vila hegwe kuhulichiza ilajizo lya heni lya kwimilila, heni nani ndokwamila ulawe goya, kuli mhela wa kuwifigwa uwelenguya kuli isi yeng'ha, kuwajeza walingikala kuli isi. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Ndanguya kwa hegwe himahima! Wibatilile goya chouwele nacho, yaleche kuya munhu kukuboka itaji lya kulajila kusumya.<verse eid="REV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />“Heye yasindile ndomdita yawe izengo kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi wa heni na holawa amo ng'oo. Kahi nani ndomwandika heye itagwa lya Nguluwi wa heni na itagwa lya muji wa Nguluwi wa heni, ayo Yelusalemu inyale, muji ulingudulika kulawa kilanga kwa Nguluwi wa heni. Kahi ndomwandika itagwa lya heni linyale.<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />“Yawele na makutu, lelo, nayagahuliche gala Muhe wa Nguluwi yalinguvilonjela vilundo vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu!<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga kwa chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu ako Laodikea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />“Kwa mhilisi wa kilanga wa chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu cha Laudikeya wandiche ahi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:14">“Awu ndo usenga ulingulawa kwa heye yalinguchemigwa Ena, mlolezi yakundigwe na wakukomya, yawele ndo chaluchizo cha vilumbigwe vyeng'ha navyoyalumbile Nguluwi, kangulonga ahi. <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />Ndizizela mbuli za hegwe zeng'ha! Ndivizela kota hegwe hauwele upwituche ama hauwele uzizime. Chiba nauwe uzizime ama upwituche. <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Ila kwa vila hegwe kwa ufufunongo, hupwituche na huwele uzizime, behi ndokudeka. <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Kwa vila kwangulonga, ‘Heni ndina lufufu, ndina chila chinhu.’ Silingugana chinhu choneche, aku, hulinguvizela kota hegwe ndo ng'hochele, kwanguganigwa konelwa isungu, mzunwa hegwe na hulingulola na kahi kusauka! <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Ndangukulanda ugule zahabu kwa heni ihovujigwe kwa chiluli leka uwe na lufufu ng'hatu. Kahi inoga ugule kahi nguwo nzelu, uvale na kugubika soni ya kusauka kwa hegwe. Kahi ugule mikwandi ukajele mmeho ga hegwe, leka ulole. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Heni ndo mbele kumng'hanuchila na kumgaza yoneche yondilingumgana. Ahyo wikangaze kwa kumgalamchila Nguluwi. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Uhulichize! Heni ndangwima hali lwizi na kugong'onda na kuchemeleza. Munhu wone yahuliche lizi lya heni na kuchumula lwizi, ndokwinjila hakaye hake na kulya chilyo hamwe naye, naye kolya hamwe na heni. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Heye yasumile ndomdita yekalise hamwe na heni hali chigoda cha undewa, kota vila heni baha vyongongomanye, nandikalisa hamwe na Mhaza wa heni hali chigoda cha undewa.<verse eid="REV 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />“Yawele na makutu, lelo, nayahuliche ulonzi awu, Muhe wa Nguluwi vyoyalingulonga na vilundo vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu!”<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s">Nhambiko ya kilanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Kulawa ago, nambona lwizi lugubuka kilanga. Lila lizi ya mwaluko yondiihuliche kota lizi ya mhalamhanda nailonga na heni, “Ukwine mbaka aku, nani ndokulajila mbuli zozilawila aho hogolawila aga.” <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Baho du namemezwa na Muhe wa Nguluwi, nambona chigoda cha undewa chiwichigwa kula kilanga na yumwe yekalise mchigoda chila. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Ayo yekalise mchigoda chila nayali yong'hala kota alimasi na kota iganga idung'hu linojile na ipinde lya nhonya liwele ling'halile kota mabwe, nauchizunguluta chila chigoda cha undewa. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Nakwali na vigoda makumi meli na gane, navizunguluta chila chigoda cha undewa na mchanya mwa vila vigoda nambona wasekulu makumi meli na gane, wekale, wavalile nguwo nzelu na vipembelo mmitwi vya zahabu. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Kuli chila chigoda cha undewa, nakwali kulawa lumwemwesa na lizi lya limlungu. Chenje saba za chiluli navyali vikwaka kumwando kwa chila chigoda cha undewa, chenje azo saba ndo muhe saba wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Kumwando kwa chila chigoda cha undewa, nakwali na chinhu chiwhanile na bahali ya chilolelo, nachali chwee kota iganga lilingung'hala lukami. Kuli banzi zeng'ha za chila chigoda, nakuzunguluta, nakwali na vilumbigwe vikomu vine. Vilumbigwe avyo navyali vimemile meho kumwando na kumbele. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Chilumbigwe acho cha mwaluko nachali kota isimba na chilumbigwe cha keli nachali kota isenga ibuguma na chilumbigwe acho cha kadatu nachali nakumeho kota kumeho kwa munhu na chilumbigwe cha kane nachali kota ikungule lilinguguluka. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Vilumbigwe avyo vine, chila chimwe nachali na mabawa sita, navyali vimemile meho mgati na kunze. Navyali hambe vyesele misi na nechilo, vilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">“Yelile, yelile, yelile, Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali lweng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">yalibaha na nayawele na yalinguya.”<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Chila mhela vilumbigwe avyo vine vyomtogola na kulonga heye ndo mkulu na kuta malumbo ayo yekalise mchanya mwa chigoda cha undewa, yalingikala mazuwa gose, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />wala wasekulu makumi meli na gane, wangigwisa hali yula yalingikala hali chila chigoda cha undewa na kumfugamila heye yawele mkomu mazuwa gose. Nawo wanguwika vipembelo vya hewo hamwando ha chila chigoda cha undewa, wolonga,<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“Mkulu na Nguluwi wa hetwe, ndo gwegwe baho wa kubochela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:11">ukulu na lutogo na mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:11">kwa vila hegwe ndo ulumbile vinhu vyeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:11">na kota vyouganile hegwe navyalibaha, navyo navilumbigwa.”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Chitabu na Mwanaing'holo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Hamba nandichona chitabu kuli moko wa kudilo wa yula yekalise mchanya mwa chigoda cha undewa, nacho nachali chandichigwe mgati na kunze na kuwohigwa kwa ihota mala saba.<figure style="fig" file="03 Seals.jpg" size="col" ref="5:1">Chitabu chibinigwe chiwohigwe na ihota mala saba</figure> <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Nandimona mhilisi wa kilanga yawele na mong'ho yodamla kwa lizi ng'hulu, “Yalikohi yawele na katogo na yalinguganigwa kubena mihota jiwichigwe mihuli na kuchigubula chitabu acho?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Nahakuwele ne yumwe kilanga na muisi na hasi ha isi, yoweza kuchigubula acho chitabu ama kuchilola mgati mwake. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Nani nandila ng'hatu kwa vila nahoneche ne yumwe wa kugubula chitabu acho ama kuchilola mgati mwake. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Hamba yumwe wa wala wasekulu nakandonjela, “Uleche kulila! Ulole! Isimba lya nhanzi ya Yudasi na lulelo lwa Daudi, heye kasumya. Heye koweza kubena jila mihota saba jiwele na mihuli na kuchigubula chila chitabu.”<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Hamba, nambona hala hagati ha chila chigoda cha undewa Mwanaing'holo limile, yazungulutwe chila ubanzi na wala wawele na ukomu wane na wala wasekulu. Ayo Mwanaing'holo nakoneka kota yakopoligwe, yawele na mbalati saba na meho saba, ziwele ndo Muhe saba wa Nguluwi zilajizwe kuli isi yeng'ha. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Yula Mwanaing'holo, nakaluta nakuchihola chila chitabu kuli moko wa heye wa kudilo wa yula yekale mchanya mwa chila chigoda cha undewa. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Baho du loyachiholile chila chitabu, awo wawele na ukomu wane na wala wasekulu makumi meli na gane nawafunama hali Mwanaing'holo. Chila yumwe wa hewo yawele na igombogombo na chifunyizi cha zahabu chimemile ubani, jiwele ndo kulanda kwa wanhu wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Nawo nawemba lwimbo lunyale wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">“Hegwe uliyeng'ha kuna katogo ka kuhola chitabu acho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">na kubena mihota ja mihuli jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">kwa vila hegwe nakukopoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">na kwa danda ya hegwe kumgulila Nguluwi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">wanhu kulawa chila nhanzi na ndonga na ivyazi na isi yeng'ha.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Kuwadita wawe undewa na watambika wamkolele mijito Nguluwi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:10">nawo wolongoza isi yeng'ha.”<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Kahi nandola, nanyulika lizi ya wahilisi wa kilanga wenji ng'hatu, huweza kuwawaza. Kulawa nzingo zeng'ha za wala wawele na ukomu na za wala wasekulu wekale kuzunguluta chigoda cha undewa, <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />walonga kwa lizi ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:12">“Mwanaing'holo yakopoligwe, ndo heye yaliyeng'ha wa kubochela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:12">ludali na lufufu na luhala na mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:12">na ukulu na lutogo na kuhulichizwa.”<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Hamba nanyulika vilumbigwe vyeng'ha kilanga na muisi na hasi ha isi na mbahali vilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:13">“Kwa heye yekalise kuli chigoda cha undewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:13">na kwa heye Mwanaing'holo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:13">kuwe na lutogo na kuhulichizwa na ukulu na ludali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:13">mazuwa gose na mazuwa gose.”<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Wala wawele na ukomu wane nawalonga, “Ena!” Nawo wasekulu wagwa chifunama, nawatambichiza.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Mwanaing'holo yalingubena mihota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Hamba, nandimona Mwanaing'holo loyabenile imwe ya jila mihota saba. Nanyhulika yumwe wa wala vilumbigwe wawele na ukomu wane wolonga kwa lizi ng'hulu kota ya limlungu, “Uye!” <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Heni nandola, nambona kwali na falasi mzelu naye yamkwinile nayali na upinde, nakapegwa itaji, naye nakalawa yawele yasumile, yawele na ludali lwa kulutilila kusumya.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Hamba, Mwanaing'holo nakabena ihota lya keli. Nandimhulika yula chilumbigwe wa keli yawele na ukomu yolonga, “Uye!” <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Nakalawa falasi yunji mdung'hu ng'hatu, naye yamkwinile nakapegwa ludali lwa kusa kikala goya muisi, leka wanhu wekopole, naye nakapegwa ipanga ikulu.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Hamba Mwanaing'holo nakabena ihota lya kadatu. Nandimhulika chilumbigwe yula wa kadatu yawele na ukomu yolonga, “Uye!” Nandola nakwali na falasi yumwe mtitu naye yamkwinile nayali na vipimilo vili mmoko mwake. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Nanyulika kota lizi hali awo wawele na ukomu wane, ilonga, “Chibaba chimwe cha utimbo wa ngano kwa migwala ja mijito ya zuwa limwe na vibaba vidatu vya uhemba kwa igwala limwe. Ila uleche kuwifya mafuta na divai.”<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Hamba, Mwanaing'holo nakabena ihota lya kane. Nandimuhulika yula chilumbigwe wa kane yawele na ukomu, yolonga, “Uye!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Nani nandola, nambona falasi yumwe yawele na lanji ya chivu, naye yamkwinile itagwa lyake ndo Kubagama na Isi ya Wabagame, nakamuwinza kumbele. Nawo nawapegwa ludali kwa lobo imwe ya isi, wawakopole wanhu kwa ipanga na lufemba na utamwa na migongolo jing'ang'ale ja kisolo.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Hamba, Mwanaing'holo nakabena ihota lya kahano. Nambona hala mlukweme lwa honhu ha kulavila nhambiko ha kufunyizila ubani hana muhe wa hewo wakopoligwe kwa chiwalo cha kudamla usenga wa Nguluwi na kulutilila kulonga kukomya kowakukundile. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Lelo, nawalila kwa lizi likulu, wolonga, “Hegwe Mkulu uwele ngulongoza, uwele welile na wa kukomya, mbaka nili kowa ubeteza kuwatagusa wala weng'ha walingikala hali isi kwa chiwalo cha kukopoligwa kwa hetwe?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Nawapegwa chila yumwe ikanzu lilefu izelu, nawalonjelwa walutilile kubeteza kwa mhela udo, mbaka vitumagwa wayawo na wayawo walingumkunda Kilistu, walinguganigwa kukopoligwa kota hewo, lowakopoligwe.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Hamba nambona, mhela Mwanaing'holo vyoyabenile ihota lya sita, nakwali na limachinyina, isanya nalyali ititu kota igunila ititu na nyelezi yeng'ha nayali ndung'hu kota danda, <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />nazo nhondwe za ulanga nazigwa mchanya mwa isi kota mafuza mabowa ga ikuyu gawele ngugwa galingutigaswa na mbeho ng'hali. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Ulanga nausigwa kota kalatasi ibinigwe na chila chidunda na chihilwa vyeng'ha navyusigwa kulawa honhu hake. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Hamba, wandewa wa isi na wakulu walingulongoza na vilongozi wa wamizi na wawele na lufufu na wawele na mong'ho na chila mpogozi na munhu yelejehe, wevisile mmhalika na mmitalawe ja vidunda. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Nawavilonjela avyo vidunda na ajo mitalawe, “Mtugwile, mkatuvise kutali na heye yekalise mchigoda cha undewa na kutali na kuzudila kwa Mwanaing'holo! <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Mina, zuwa iwele ng'hulu ya kutagusigwa kwa hewo ifika. Whaani yoweza kwima nzinzili?”<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa Isilaeli wawichigwe muhuli ni lachi imwe na makumi gane na elufu zine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Logakwete ago nandiwona wahilisi wa kilanga wane wemile kuli nzingo zine za isi, wolemeza mbeho zine za isi leka mbeho zileche kuputa mchanya mwa isi ne mchanya mwa bahali ne mchanya mwa migodi. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Hamba, nandimona mhilisi yunji yokwina kulawa kolilawilaga isanya, yawele na muhuli wa Nguluwi yawele mkomu. Nakakwiniza lizi na kuwalonjela wahilisi wa kilanga wane wapeligwe ludali lwa kuwifya isi na bahali, <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />yula mhilisi nakalonga, “Mleche kuwifya isi ne bahali ne migodi, mbaka hotusinda kuwawika muhuli vitumagwa wa Nguluwi wa hetwe mli vihanga vya hewo.” <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Hamba, nanyulika hisabu ya hewo wawichigwe muhuli kuli nhanzi ya Waisilaeli, wanhu lachi imwe na makumi gane na elufu zine (144,000). <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Nhanzi ya Yudasi wanhu kumi na mbili elufu (12,000) wawichigwe muhuli na wa nhanzi ya Lubeni wanhu kumi na mbili elufu (12,000) wawichigwe muhuli na wa nhanzi ya Gadi, wanhu kumi na mbili elufu (12,000) wawichigwe muhuli <verse eid="REV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />na wa nhanzi ya Asheli, wanhu kumi na mbili elufu (12,000) wawichigwe muhuli na wa nhanzi ya Nafutali, wanhu kumi na mbili elufu (12,000) wawichigwe muhuli na wa nhanzi ya Manase, wanhu kumi na mbili elufu (12,000) wawichigwe muhuli <verse eid="REV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />na wa nhanzi ya Simoni, wanhu kumi na mbili elufu (12,000) wawichigwe muhuli na wa nhanzi ya Lawi, wanhu kumi na mbili elufu (12,000) wawichigwe muhuli na wa nhanzi ya Isakali, wanhu kumi na mbili elufu (12,000) wawichigwe muhuli <verse eid="REV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />na wa nhanzi ya Sebuluni, wanhu kumi na mbili elufu (12,000) wawichigwe muhuli na wa nhanzi ya Yusufu, wanhu kumi na mbili elufu (12,000) wawichigwe muhuli na wa nhanzi ya Benjamini, wanhu kumi na mbili elufu (12,000) wawichigwe muhuli.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likugusi lya Wanhu wa chila nhanzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Hamba, nandola nambona likugusi lya wanhu wa chila nhanzi na lukolo na ndonga, wemile kumwando mwa chigoda cha undewa na kumwando kwa Mwanaing'holo, wavalile nguwo nzelu na miputi ja uchindu mmoko mwao. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Nawakwiniza lizi wolonga, “Ulohozi wangulawa kwa Nguluwi wa hetwe yekalise kuli chigoda cha undewa na vivila wangulawa kwa Mwanaing'holo.” <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Wahilisi wa kilanga weng'ha nawema kuchizunguluta chila chigoda cha undewa na vila vilumbigwe viwele na ukomu vine. Nawagwa chifunami kumwando kwa chila chigoda cha undewa, wamfugamila Nguluwi, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />wolonga, “Ena! Kutogola na ukulu na luhala na malumbo na mong'ho na kuhulichiza kwa Nguluwi wa hetwe, mazuwa gose, Ena!”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Nakedichila yumwe wa wala wasekulu, yondonjela, ndaze! “Wanhu awa wavalizwe nguwo nzelu ndo whaani? Na walawa kohi?” <verse eid="REV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Nandimwidichila, “Mkulu, hegwe kuvizela!” Naye nakandonjela, “Awa ndo walingulawa kuli gala magazo makulu, nawo wahovuga nguwo za hewo na kuzidita ziwe nzelu chwee! Kuli danda ya Mwanaing'holo. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Ahyo, wa kumwando kwa chigoda cha undewa cha Nguluwi, nawo wangumkolela Nguluwi mijito, nemisi na nechilo kuli ng'handa ya heye. Heye yalingikala kuli chigoda cha undewa kowamila. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Howokona nzala kahi ne howokona ng'halu. Ne howolyona isanya ne ivuche ling'hang'ale haliwalakaza. <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />Mina, ayo Mwanaing'holo yawele hagati ya chigoda cha undewa, kowadima, naye kowalongoza kuli nzasa ya mazi gawele na ukomu. Naye Nguluwi kogabagusa mahozi geng'ha kuli meho ga hewo.”<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">Ihota lya saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Mwanaing'holo loyabenile ihota lya saba, nakwali tulu kilanga kwa mhela wa nusu saa. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Nani nandiwona wahilisi wa kilanga saba walingwima kumwando kwa Nguluwi, nawo nawapegwa mhalamhanda saba.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Mhilisi wa kilanga yunji nakeza, nakema kumwando mwa honhu ha kulavila nhambiko yawele na chifunyizi cha zahabu. Naye nakapegwa ubani winji yaulavye ndolendole hamwe na kulanda kwa wanhu wa Nguluwi weng'ha mchanya mwa honhu ha kulavila nhambiko ha zahabu, iwele kumwando kwa chigoda cha undewa. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Iyosi lya ula ubani naukwina kilanga kwa Nguluwi hamwe na kulanda kwa wanhu wa Nguluwi kulawa mmoko mwa wahilisi wa kilanga walingwima kumwando kwa Nguluwi. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Hamba, mhilisi wa kilanga nakahola chifunyizi chichila, nakachimemeza makala ga chiluli kulawa kuli honhu ha kulavila nhambiko, nakachitoza kuli isi. Nakulawila lizi na lumwemwesa na limachinyina.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhalamanda ya mwaluko mbaka ya kane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Hamba, wala wahilisi wa kilanga saba wawele na mhalamhanda saba nawewika goya leka wapembe. <verse eid="REV 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Mhilisi wa mwaluko nakapemba mhalamhanda. Nakulawila na nhonya ya maganga na chiluli vibatane na danda, navitozwa mchanya mwa isi. Imwe ya kadatu ya isi naisomigwa na imwe ya kadatu ya migodi naisomigwa na mahamba madeche geng'ha nagalakala. <verse eid="REV 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Hamba mhilisi wa kilanga wa keli nakapemba mhalamhanda. Chinhu chifandile kota chidunda chikulu chilingwaka chiluli, nachitajigwa kuli bahali. Imwe ya kadatu ya bahali nayali danda, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />imwe ya kadatu ya vilumbigwe vinji naviwele mbahali na viwele na ukomu navibagama na imwe ya kadatu ya mitumbwi mikulu nachiwifigwa.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Hamba, mhilisi wa kilanga wa kadatu nakapemba mhalamhanda. Nhondwe ng'hulu nailagala kulawa kilanga, ikwaka kota chenje, nakugwila kuli imwe ya kadatu ya nzanda na mli nzasa za mazi. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Nhondwe ayo naichemigwa usungu. Lelo, imwe ya kadatu ya gala mazi gawa ga usungu na wanhu wenji nawabagama kwa mazi ago, kwa vila nagajelwa usungu.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Hamba, mhilisi wa kilanga wa kane nakapemba mhalamhanda. Isanya na nyelezi na nhondwe navitowigwa na kwajiliza imwe ya kadatu ya kulavya lumuli. Imwe ya kadatu ya nemisi nahaiwele na lumuli lwa isanya. Imwe ya kadatu ya nechilo nahaiwele na lumuli lwa nyelezi na nhondwe. <verse eid="REV 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Hamba, nambona na kuhulika ikungule limwe liguluka mchanya ng'hatu kilanga, lilonga kwa lizi ng'hulu, “Wogaya, wogaya, wogaya wawo, walingikala mchanya mwa isi! Mhela wahilisi wa kilanga wadatu waponile howopemba mhalamhanda zawo!”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Mhilisi wa kilanga wa kahano nakapemba mhalamhanda. Nambona nhondwe ilawile kilanga, ilagala mchanya mwa isi. Naye nakapegwa chichumulilo cha kwinjilila kuli ikulubila. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Nakalichumula ikulubila lyohambe lidume, nakulawa iyosi lya itanulu ikulu. Isanya na ulanga naviwichigwa jiza kwa iyosi lya ikulubila alyo. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Nzije nazilawa kuli iyosi alyo, nazinjila muisi, nawapegwa ludali kota wa nyinje. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Nazilonjelwa zileche kuwifya misolo na mahamba ga isi ne chinhu choneche chiwele chideche ne igodi lyoneche, ila wawawifye hela wala wanhu wasowile muhuli wa Nguluwi kuli vihanga vya hewo. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Nzije azo nazipegwa malajizo kota zileche kuwakopola, ila wagazigwe myezi jihano. Usungu wa magazo nawali kota munhu yalumigwe na nyinje. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Mazuwa gala, wanhu wopala kubagama ila howobagama, wopala nzila ya kubagama ila hawoyona hebu.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Nakoneka kwa azo nzije, nakwali kota falasi wawichigwe goya kwa ngondo. Mchanya mwa vitwi vya hewo nawali na vinhu vifandile kota chipembelo cha zahabu na kumeho kwa hewo nakwali kota za wanhu. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Nawo nawali na mnvili kota mnvili za wadala na mizino jawo najali kota mizino ja isimba. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Mhambaga za hewo nazali zigubikwe na chinhu kota ngwamo ya chuma. Lizi lya mabawa ga hewo nayali kota lizi ya mutuka ilingukwejigwa na falasi wenji walingubilima himahima kuluta kuli ngondo. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Nawo nawali na michila kota ja nyinje na michila ja hewo jali na ludali lwa kuwagaza wanhu myezi jihano. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Wanaye mndewa yalinguwalongoza, naye ndo mhilisi wa lila ikulubila kuli isi ya wabagame na itagwa lyake kwa Chiebulaniya ndo Abadoni na kwa Kiyunani kanalo itagwa lyake Apoliyoni ilinguzelaka kota, “Yalingugaza.”<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Kugaya kwa mwaluko mina kupuluta, ila ulole, kung'hali kugaya kwili kulinguya hamba.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Hamba, mhilisi wa kilanga wa sita nakapemba mhalamhanda yake. Nanyulika lizi ilawile kuli zila mbalati zine za honhu ha kulavila nhambiko ha zahabu hawele kumwando kwa Nguluwi. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Lizi ayo naimlonjela yula mhilisi wa sita nayawele na mhalamhanda, “Uwachumulile awo wahilisi wa kilanga wawohigwe habehi na lwanda lukulu lwa Eyufulate!” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Wala vitumagwa wane wa Limazoga nawachumulilwa, nawawele wawichigwe goya kwa yila saa na zuwa na mwezi na mhela, leka wakopole imwe ya kadatu ya wanhu muisi. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Nanyulika awo wamizi walingukwina falasi nawali miliyoni miya mbili (200,000,0000). <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Ahyo navyombonile awo falasi na wakwinile falasi kuli ulotezi wa heni. Nawali na ngwamo za chuma mhambaga, ziwele kota chiluli, ziwele na lanji ndung'hu na buluu na njano na vitwi vya falasi awo ndo kota vitwi vya isimba na kuli milomo jawo mwangulawa milapi ja chiluli na iyosi na baluti ilingwaka. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Kwa mbuli azo za kugaya kwa kadatu, nagakopola imwe ya kadatu ya wanhu muisi, iwele ndo iyosi na baluti ilingwaka naiwele ilawa kuli milomo ja awo falasi. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Ludali lwa awo falasi nalwali mmilomo jawo na kuli michila jawo. Michila jawo najali kota mizoka na najali na mitwi, jiwele nawawalumiza wanhu kwa michila ajo.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Wanhu wanji waponile, wohawakopoligwe kwa kugazigwa ako, hawamgalamchile Nguluwi na hawalechile kufugamila vinhu wagongomanye kwa moko gawo, ne hawalechile kutambichila jimazoga na jimalukolo ja zahabu na ja sendi na shaba na ja maganga na ja migodi, johajidahile kulola na kuhulika ne kujenda. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Wala wohambe wamgalamchile Nguluwi na kuleka kukopola na uhawi na ung'hondwa na uhizi.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Wahilisi na chitabu chidodo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Hamba nandimona mhilisi wa kilanga yunji yawele na ludali yodulika kulawa kilanga. Nayali yavalizwe ng'hungugu na ipinde lya nhonya mchanya mwa mutwi wa heye. Kumeho kwa heye nakwali kota isanya na magulu ga heye kota mizengo ja chiluli. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Mmoko wa heye nakebata chitabu chidodo chigubuligwe. Nakawika mgulu wa heye wa kudilo mchanya mwa bahali na mgulu wa kumoso mchanya mwa isi, <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />naye nakachema kwa lizi ng'hulu kota isimba lilingubuma. Naloyakwinize lizi, mibumo saba najidichila kota limlungu. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Ajo mibumo saba lojilavile lizi, nandali ndikale goya kwandika, ila nanyhulika lizi kulawa kilanga ilonga, “Ulonzi wa ajo mibumo saba ndo uviso, uleche kwandika!”<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Hamba yula mhilisi wa kilanga yondimuwene yokwima mchanya mwa bahali na mchanya mwa isi nakenula moko wa heye wa kudilo kulajila kilanga, <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />nakelaha kwa itagwa lya Nguluwi yalingikala mazuwa gose, heye yalumbile kilanga na isi na bahali na vinhu vyeng'ha viwele mumo, nakalonga, “Mhela wa kubeteza umala! <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Ila mhela yula mhilisi wa kilanga wa saba hoyopemba mhalamhanda, majesa ga uviso ga Nguluwi kwa mbuli zoyaganile zokwenela, kota navyoyawadamlile waloli nawawele vitumagwa wa heye.”<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Hamba, lizi yila yonyhuliche kulawa kilanga aho mwaluko, nailonga na heni kahi, ilonga, “Ulute, ukachihole chila chitabu chigubuligwe kuli moko wa yula mhilisi wa kilanga yemile mchanya mwa bahali na mchanya mwa isi.” <verse eid="REV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Lelo, nandimlutila yula mhilisi wa kilanga nakumlonjela umhe chila chitabu chidodo. Naye nakandonjela, “Chihole, ulye. Kuli mlomo wa hegwe chowa chinonile kota hanombwa, ila mmunda wa hegwe chowa chausungu!” <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Lelo, nandichihola chila chitabu chidodo kulawa kuli moko wa yula mhilisi wa kilanga, nandichilya. Nacho nachinona kota hanombwa mumlomo mwangu, ila lomelile nachali chausungu mmunda mwa heni. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Hamba, nawandonjela, “Kwanguganigwa kulavya uloli kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wenji wa isi na nhanzi na wanhu wa ndonga nyinji na wandewa!”<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s">Walolezi weli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Hamba, namhegwa idenje liwele kota ng'hweku ya kupimila, nandonjelwa, “Winuche ukapime ng'handa ya Nguluwi na honhu ha kulavila nhambiko ha kufunyizila ubani na kuwawaliza wanhu walingufugama mng'handa ya Nguluwi. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Ila uleche luga luwele kunze kwa ng'handa ya Nguluwi uleche kupima vihengo vya kunze, mina awo wapegwa wanhu wa isi zinji, wawele nguubiga mji welile kwa mhela wa myezi makumi gane na meli. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Nani ndowalajiza walolezi wa heni weli leka walavye usenga kulawa kwa Nguluwi kwa mhela wa mazuwa elufu imwe na miya mbili na makumi sita (1,260), wawele wavalile migunila.”<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Awo walolezi weli ndo kiwhana na migodi mili ja mizeituni na vinhu vili vya kuwichila chenje viwele ngwima hali Mkulu wa isi. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Ila munhu wone yajeze kuwadumya, chiluli cholawa kumlomo kwa hewo wawo na kuwadumya wehile wa hewo na chila munhu yojeza kudumya, kobagama kota ahyo. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Vitumagwa wa Nguluwi wana ludali lwa kudinya kilanga, nhonya ileche kutowa mhela howolavya uloli. Kahi wana ludali lwa kugagalamla mazi gawe danda na kuitowa isi na chila mbuli za kudumya kwa chila mhela howogana wawo.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Ila howosinda kulavya ulolezi awo, igongolo ling'ang'ale lilingulawa mlikulubila, lyochitowa na hewo na kuwakopola. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Mitufi ja hewo jopona kuli nzila za muji ukulu nawoyagazigwe Mkulu wa hewo. Itagwa lya muji awo lyanguchemigwa Sodoma ama Misili. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Wanhu weng'ha na chila isi na nhanzi na ndonga na lukolo na lanji wolola mitufi ajo kwa mhela wa zuwa zidatu na nusu na howokundiza zitiligwe mchilaga. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Wanhu wawele ngikala muisi wosechelela kubagama kwa hewo weli. Wodita mvina na kihilichila ndolendole, mina waloli awa weli nawali wawagazile lukami wanhu wa isi. <verse eid="REV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Logamalile mazuwa gala gadatu na nusu, muhe wa ukomu kulawa kwa Nguluwi nauwenjila, nawo nawema, wanhu weng'ha wawawene nawadumba lukami. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Hamba, awo waloli weli nawahulika lizi ling'angala kulawa kilanga iwalonjela, “Mkwine mbaka kuno.” Nawo nawakwina kuchanya kilanga kuli ng'hungugu, aku wang'honyo wa hewo wowalola. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Mhela wuwo, nakulawila limachinyina likulu lya isi na imwe ya kumi ya muji naigwa. Wanhu elufu saba (7,000) nawabagama kwa limachinyina lila. Wanhu waponile nawadumba ng'hatu na kumtogola Nguluwi wa kilanga.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Aku kugaya kwa keli kupuluta, ila kugaya kwa kadatu kwanguya himahima.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhalamhanda ya saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Muhilisi wa kilanga wa saba nakapemba mhalamhanda ya heye. Lizi ling'angala naihulikwa kilanga ilonga, “Undewa wa isi sambi uwa undewa wa Mkulu Nguluwi wa hetwe na Kilistu Mlohozi, naye kolongoza mazuwa gose!” <verse eid="REV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Hamba, wala wasekulu makumi meli na gane, wawele ngikalisa kuli vigoda vya undewa, hala hoyawele Nguluwi nawagwa chifunama, nawamfugamila Nguluwi, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />wone walonje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:17">“Twanguta malumbo hegwe Mkulu Nguluwi Uwele na Ludali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:17">uwele bahano na ulinguya!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:17">Mina kwa ludali lwa hegwe lukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:17">kwangwaluka kulongoza.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Wanhu wa isi zeng'ha nawali wazudile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">ila kuzudila kwa hegwe kuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">ena mhela wa kuwatagusa wabagame.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">Wuwo ndo mhela wa kuwalolela vitumagwa wa hegwe wawele ndo waloli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">na wanhu wa hegwe weng'ha welile walingulitogola itagwa lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">wakulu kwa wadodo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">Kahi ndo mhela wa kuwadumya weng'ha walinguidumya isi.”<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Hamba ng'handa ya Nguluwi iwele kilanga naigubuligwa na isanduku lya heye lya ilagano nalyoneka mli ng'handa ya Nguluwi. Nakulawila lumwemwesa na lizi na limlungu na limachinyina na nhonya ng'hulu ya maganga.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">Mdala na Izoka ikulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Hamba, ulajilo ukulu nawoneka kilanga, nakwali na mdala yavalizwe isanya na nyelezi hasi hali magulu ga heye na mmutwi wa heye, nakavalizwa chipembelo cha nhondwe kumi na mbili. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Nayali na himila, naye nakalila kwa usungu uwele kota wula usungu wa kuponda mwana.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Hamba, nawoneka ulajilo unji kilanga, ulole, izoka likulu lidung'hu, lyali na vitwi saba na mbalati kumi na chila mutwi nawali na chipembelo. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Mchila wa alyo izoka likulu naubuluna imwe ya kadatu ya nhondwe za kuulanga, nakuzilagaza muisi. Hamba lila izoka likulu nalima kumwando kwa yula mdala yawele behi na kuponda leka hoyoponda, limmele yula mwana. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Hamba, yula mdala nakaponda mwana mlume, heye kowadima wanhu wa isi zeng'ha kwa ng'hweku yiyo ya chuma. Mwana wa heye nakanyasuligwa mbaka kwa Nguluwi kuli chigoda cha heye cha undewa. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Yula mdala nakabilimila kuchiwala, koyawele na honhu hoyawichigwe na Nguluwi, leka wamhe chilyo ako, kwa mhela wa mazuwa elufu imwe na miya mbili na makumi sita (1,260).<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Nakwali na ngondo kilanga, Mikaeli hamwe na wahilisi wa kilanga wayage wa kilanga nawetowa na lila izoka likulu, na lila izoka nalyo nalitowa na hewo hamwe na vitumagwa wa heye, <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />ila izoka alyo na vitumagwa wa heye nahawasumile, honhu awo hahoneche kahi kilanga. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Lelo, izoka alyo nalitozwa hanyi muisi, izoka alyo ndo lila lya katali, liwele nguchemigwa Chijeni ama Limazoga, liwele nguwahada wanhu weng'ha wa isi, ena nalitozigwa muisi hamwe na vitumagwa weng'ha wa heye.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Hamba nanyulika lizi likulu kulawa kilanga, ilonga, “Sambi Nguluwi kanguwalohola wanhu wa heye na Nguluwi mndewa wa hetwe kangulajila ludali lwake na Kilistu Mlohozi wa heye kangulajila ludali lwa heye. Mina yula yalinguwasonjeleza wanhu wa hetwe nemisi na nechilo katozigwa hasi. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Wang'holozetu nawamsumya kwa danda ya Mwanaing'holo na kulutilila kuwalonjela wanhu wanji ulonzi wa Nguluwi, mina hawadumbile kulavya ukomu wa hewo, nawali goya kubagama. <verse eid="REV 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Ahyo, msechelele, hemwe kilanga, namwe mlingikala amo. Ila wochona kwa isi na bahali! Kwa vila lila Limazoga lidulika kwa hemwe liwele lizudile ng'hatu, livizelele kota lina mhela udo hela.”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Izoka alyo likulu vyoliwene kota nalitozigwa muisi, nalyaluka kumpugajiza mdala yula yapondile mwana mlume ligana kumkopola. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Mdala yula nakapegwa mabawa meli ga ikungule, leka yaguluche, yalute kutali ng'hatu na alyo izoka ako kuchiwala mbaka kuli honhu hake, aho hoyololigwa goya kwa mihela jidatu na nusu. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Lelo, alyo izoka nalideka mazi kota lwanda luwele na mazi menji kumbele kwa ayo mdala, leka yaholigwe na lwanda lula. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Ila isi naimtanza mdala ayo. Naigubuka kota mlomo na kuumela lwanda lula, ulawile kuli mlomo wa alyo izoka. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Lelo, Izoka nalizudizwa na yula mdala, naliluta kudita ngondo kwa lulelo lwa heye luponile lwa ayo mdala, weng'ha walinguhulichiza mzilo woyawichile Nguluwi, kuli kukomya kugubuligwe na Yesu. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Hamba izoka nalima hafungo mwa bahali.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Migongolo mili jing'ang'ale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Hamba nambona igongolo limwe lilawa kuli bahali, liwele na vitwi saba na mbalati kumi, nachila mbalati nayali na chipembelo. Itagwa lya kumliga Nguluwi nalyandichigwa kuli chila mutwi. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Lila igongolo ndiliwene nalyali lifandile kota iduma, magulu gake nagali kota magulu ga idubu na mlomo wa heye nawali kota mlomo wa isimba. Lila izoka nalimha lila igongolo mong'ho wake na chigoda cha heye cha undewa na ludali lwinji. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Mutwi umwe wa alyo igongolo nawoneka kota nawali ulumizwe lukami, ila chilonda acho nachali chiponile. Wanhu wa isi yeng'ha nawabubuwazwa na igongolo lila na kuliwinza. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Wanhu weng'ha nawalifugamila alila izoka kwa vila nalimha alila igongolo ludali lwake. Hewo nawalifugamila alila igongolo, wolonga, “Whaani yewhanile na igongolo alino? Kahi whaani yoweza kitowa nalyo?”<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Alila igongolo nalikundizwa kulonga ulonzi wa kidaya na wa kumliga Nguluwi. Nakapegwa ludali lwa kudita mijito ja heye, mihela makumi gane na meli. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Lelo, nakaluka kumliga Nguluwi na kuliliga itagwa lya heye na kuliga honhu hoyalingikala Nguluwi na wala weng'ha walingikala kilanga. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Igongolo ling'ang'ale nalikundizwa kitowa ngondo na kuwasumya wanhu wa Nguluwi. Nakapegwa ludali kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wa chila isi na chila nhanzi na lukolo na ndonga. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Wanhu weng'ha wawele ngikala muisi womfugamila, ila wala hela wawele matagwa ga hewo nagandichigwa kuli chitabu cha ukomu cha Mwanaing'holo yakopoligwe kulawa mwaluko wa isi.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />“Yawele na makutu ga kuhulika, nayahuliche!<verse eid="REV 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Yaganigwe kibatigwa kuli ngondo, kobatigwa kuli ngondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 13:10">Wa kukopoligwa kwa ipanga, naye kokopoligwa kwa ipanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 13:10">Ayi ndo nyhemo kwa wanhu wa Nguluwi wawe na kwimilila na makundo.”<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Hamba, nambona igongolo linji, likwina kulawa kuli isi, nalyo nalyali na mbalati mbili kota za mwanaing'holo, nalilonga kota izoka. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Nalyo nalyali na ludali lweng'ha lwa lila igongolo lya mwaluko. Naliditila mijito ludali alo kumwando kwa alyo igongolo, naliikola lupichi isi yeng'ha na weng'ha wawele mumo, walifugamile lila igongolo lya mwaluko, yawele na ng'hovu ya chila chilonda cha kubagama chiponile. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Lelo, ali igongolo lya keli nalilajila vinduzanduza vikulu, mbaka kudita chiluli kudulika kulawa kilanga uye mchanya mwa isi kumwando kwa wanhu weng'ha. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Nalyo naliwahada wala walingikala muisi kwa vinduzanduza avyo vyoyapegwe kudita hali alyo igongolo lya mwaluko. Igongolo alyo, naliwalonjela walingikala muisi, wagomanjize limalukolo kwa kulitogola lila igongolo naliwele lilumizwe vibi, ila naliwa likomu kahi. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Nalipegwa kujela ukomu kuli lila limalukolo lya igongolo lya mwaluko na lila limalukolo lya igongolo lilonje na kuwakopola wanhu weng'ha wohambe wafugamile limalukolo lya igongolo. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Naliwadita weng'ha, wadodo na wakulu na wawele na lufufu kwa wazunwa na welejehe kwa wapogozi, wawichigwe ulajilo kuli moko wa hewo wa kudilo ama kuli vihanga vya hewo. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Kahi nalilemeza munhu yoneche yaleche kugula wala kuguza chinhu, ila yawele na ulajilo awo, uwele ndo itagwa lya igongolo lila ama namba ya itagwa lya heye.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Aha ndo hawele na luhala lulinguganigwa. Heye yawele na nyhala kangutang'ula winji wa igongolo alyo, mina ndo winji wa chiwunhu na namba yake ndo miya sita na makumi sita na sita (666).<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Mwanaing'holo na wanhu wa heye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Hamba, nambona Mwanaing'holo yemile mchanya mwa chidunda cha Siyoni, hamwe na wanhu wa heye, lachi imwe na elufu makumi gane na zine (144,000) wawele na itagwa lya heye na itagwa lya mhaza wa heye, lyandichigwe kuli vihanga vya hewo. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Lelo, nanyulika lizi kulawa kilanga, kota lizi lya kubogoma kwa mazi menji na kota lizi lya limlungu lilingubuma. Lizi yonyuliche nayali kota lizi ya wavina muzichi wotowa ving'weleng'wele vya hewo. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Nawali wokwimba lwimbo lunyale kumwando kwa chigoda cha undewa na kumwando kwa wala vilumbigwe wawele na ukomu wane na wala wasekulu. Kuduhuli munhu yajezile kilangusa lwimbo ula ila wala wanhu lachi imwe na elufu makumi gane na zine (144,000) nawagomboligwe kuli isi. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Wanhu awa ndo nahawawele wakokomoche kwa kuwasa na wadala, nawo ndo hawanawasa na wadala. Awa ndo walingumuwinza Mwanaing'holo chila hoyoluta. Awa wagomboligwa kuli wanhu, nawali wa mwaluko kulavigwa kwa Nguluwi na kwa Mwanaing'holo. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Mli milomo ja hewo, hawoneche udesi, mina nawalihela wihe.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wahilisi wadatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Hamba, nambona mhilisi wa kilanga yunji, yoguluka kilanga, yawele na Mbuli Inojile ya mazuwa gose ya Nguluwi, yowadamlila awo wanhu walingikala kuli isi na chila isi na nhanzi na lukolo na ndonga, <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />yolonga kwa lizi ng'hulu, “Mumdumbe Nguluwi na kuutogola ukulu wa heye! Mina mhela wa kuwatagusa wanhu wuya. Mumfugamile heye yaditile kilanga na isi na bahali na nzasa za mazi.”<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Hamba mhilisi wa kilanga yunji wa keli nakamuwinza, ayo wa mwaluko yolonga, “Ugwa! Muji ukulu wa Babiloni ugwa! Mina hegwe ndo unwezile isi zeng'ha divai ya heye ing'ang'ale ilinguwambuza wanhu wawe na maya ga kudita ung'hondwa!”<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Mhilisi wa kilanga wa kadatu, nakawawinza awo weli yolonga kwa lizi likulu, “Munhu yoneche yolifugamila alyo igongolo na limalukolo lyake na kubochela ulajilo kuli chihanga cha heye ama kuli moko wa heye, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />heye yuye konwa divai ya kuzudila kwa Nguluwi ijidigwe mli chizombe cha kuzudila kwa heye ne kuhanzanywa na mazi. Munhu ayo kogazigwa kuli chiluli na kwa baluti kumwando mwa wahilisi wa kilanga welile na kumwando kwa Mwanaing'holo. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Iyosi lya chiluli liwele nguwagaza lyangukwina mchanya mazuwa gose. Wanhu awo walingulifugamila alyo igongolo ling'ang'ale na limalukolo lya heye na kuwichigwa ulajilo wa itagwa lya heye, hawowa na mhumu nemisi na nechilo.”<verse eid="REV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Ahyo, ndo wanhu wa Nguluwi vyowalinguganigwa, mina wala wanhu wawele nguwinza mzilo wa Nguluwi na wawele na makundo kwa Yesu, wawe wemilile.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Hamba, nyhulika lizi lilawa kilanga lilonga, “Wandiche! Kulawa sambi, wabweda wanhu wawele ngubagama welumbile na Mkulu.” Naye Muhe kangulonga, “Ena! Wokwesela kulawa kuli magazo ga hewo, mina wosangalala kwa chiwalo cha mijito ja kitunya kwa hewo.”<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa isi wangukungajizwa kota zabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Hamba, nandola aku, nakwali na ng'hungugu nzelu aho. Mchanya mwa ng'hungugu ayo nakwali na yumwe yawele kota Mwana wa munhu. Heye nayali yavalile chipembelo cha zahabu kumutwi na kibata sengo mmoko mwa heye. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Hamba mhilisi yunji wa kilanga nakalawa mli ng'handa ya Nguluwi ya ako kilanga, kwa lizi ng'hulu naimlonjela yula yekalise mchanya mwa ng'hungugu, “Dedede, ukolele mijito sengo ya hegwe, ukabete mbena, mina mhela wa mbena wuya, mbena ya isi ya goya.” <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Lelo, yula yawele yekalise mchanya mwa ng'hungugu na kupujila sengo ya heye muisi, mbena ya isi ibetigwa. <verse eid="REV 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Hamba, mhilisi wa kilanga myage nakalawa kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi iwele kilanga yebate sengo iwele inoligwe ng'hatu.<verse eid="REV 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Hamba, mhilisi wa kilanga myage yawele na ludali lwa chiluli, nakalawa kuli honhu ha kulavila nhambiko, nakamlonjela kwa lizi ling'angala yula mhilisi yawele na sengo inoligwe ng'atu, “Nagwe ukanole ayo sengo ya hegwe, ukadumule sanha za mizabibu ja isi, mina zabibu za heye zipya!” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Lelo, mhilisi wa kilanga ayu nakataga sengo ya heye muisi, nakakana sanha za izabibu lya isi, nakazinjiza honhu ha kukamila zabibu, honhu hawele na kuzudila kwa Nguluwi. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Zabibu zikamigwe mgati mwa alyo ikamilo liwele kunze kwa muji na danda ilawa kuli ikamilo alyo yanguchililika kota lwanda na kumema mbaka wimo wa mita imwe na nusu na ulefu uwele ngufika kilomita miya mbili (200).<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">Wahilisi saba wawele na nongwa saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Hamba nambona ulajilo wunji ukulu na wa kububuwaza kilanga, nakwali aho wahilisi wa kilanga saba wawele na nongwa saba za kuduma, kwa nongwa azo saba, kuzudila kwa Nguluwi nakwenela.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Hamba, nambona chinhu kota ulajilo wa bahali ya chilolelo ihanzigwe hamwe na chiluli. Hafungo ha ayo bahali nandiwona wanhu walisumile lila igongolo na limalukolo na namba ya itagwa lya heye. Mmoko mwao nawali webate ving'weleng'wele vyowapegwe na Nguluwi. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Nawali wokwimba lwimbo lwa Musa chitumagwa wa Nguluwi na lwimbo lwa Mwanaing'holo, wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">“Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">madito ga hegwe ndo makulu na ga kububuwaza ng'hatu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">Hegwe mndewa wa isi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">nzila za hegwe zitanganika na za kukomya.<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Mkulu, ndo whaani yohambe yakudumbe hegwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">Whaani yohambe yalitogole itagwa lya hegwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">Hegwe uliyeng'ha ndo welile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">Wanhu wa isi zeng'ha wokuyila na kukufugamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">mina madito ga hegwe ganojile goneka.”<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Logapulute ago, nambona, ng'handa ya Nguluwi igubuligwe kilanga na mgati mwake nambona ihema lya ulolezi wakuwabaho Nguluwi. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Lelo, wala wahilisi wa kilanga saba, wawele na nongwa saba, nawalawa amo mng'handa ya Nguluwi, wavalizwe nguwo za kitani zinojile ziwele zing'halile na wawopigwe mmhambaga mwa hewo misali ja zahabu. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Yumwe wa vila vilumbigwe wane wawele na ukomu, nakawapa wala wahilisi wa kilanga saba visaye saba vya zahabu vimemile kuzudila kwa Nguluwi, yalingikala mazuwa gose. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Ng'handa ya Nguluwi naimemezwa iyosi lilingulawila kuli ukulu na ludali lwa Nguluwi na hapawele na munhu yadahile kwinjila mng'handa ya Nguluwi mbaka kuduma kwa nongwa saba za wala wahilisi wa kilanga saba.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s">Visaye saba vya kuzudila kwa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Hamba nanyulika lizi ling'angala kulawa kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi iwalonjela wala wahilisi wa kilanga saba, “Mlute mkabohole vila visaye saba vya kuzudila kwa Nguluwi kuli isi.”<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Lelo, mhilisi wa mwaluko nakaluta nakubohola chisaye cha heye mchanya mwa isi. Baho du, mipu jihile na ja kulumiza ng'hatu na jiwafika weng'ha wawele na ndonya ya lila igongolo na wala walifugamile limalukolo lya heye.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Mhilisi wa keli nakabohola chisaye cha heye mbahali. Nago mazi ga bahali nagagaluka danda kota danda ya munhu yabagame na vilumbigwe vyeng'ha naviwele na ukomu mbahali navibagama.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Mhilisi wa kadatu nakabohola chisaye cha heye kuli nzanda na nzasa za mazi, navyo navigaluka danda. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Heni nandimuhulika mhilisi wa kilanga mwamizi wa mazi yolonga, “Hegwe kudita kota navyoiganigwe, kutagusa goya mbuli ayo. Hegwe welile, uwele baha na uwele bahano! <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Kwa vila nawabohola danda ya wanhu wa Nguluwi na waloli, nagwe kuwapa danda wanwe, kwa vila nawaganigwa wadite ahyo!” <verse eid="REV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Nanyulika ayo lizi ilawile kuli honhu ha kulavila nhambiko ilonga, “Ena, Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali, hegwe kwangulavya utaguso utanganiche na wa kukomya!” <verse eid="REV 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Hamba mhilisi wa kane nakabohola chisaye cha heye mchanya mwa isanya. Isanya nalipegwa ludali lwa kuwalakaza wanhu kwa chiluli cha heye. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Lelo, wanhu nawalakazwa vibi ng'hatu, nawo nawaliliga itagwa lya Nguluwi yawele na ludali hali nongwa azo. Ila nahawamgalamchile Nguluwi na kumtogola.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Hamba, mhilisi wa kahano nakabohola chisaye cha heye mchanya mwa chigoda cha undewa cha lila igongolo. Undewa wa igongolo alyo nauwichigwa jiza, wanhu nawadakula umyango wa hewo kwa chiwalo cha usungu, <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />nawamliga Nguluwi wa kilanga kwa chiwalo cha usungu wa hewo na kwa chiwalo cha mipu ja hewo. Ila hawamgalamchile Nguluwi kwa madito ga hewo gehile.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Hamba, mhilisi wa sita nakabohola chisaye cha heye mchanya mwa lwanda lukulu uwele nguchemigwa Eyufulate. Mazi gake nagakala, ahyo naiwichigwa nzila igongomanywe kwa chiwalo cha wandewa walingulawa kolilawilaga isanya. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Hamba, nambona vijeni vihile vidatu viwhanile na mibula, vilawa kuli mlomo wa lila izoka likulu na chimwe nachilawa kuli mlomo wa lila igongolo na chimwe nachilawa kuli mlomo wa yula mloli wa udesi. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Awa muhe wadatu wa vijeni viwele ngulajila vinduzanduza. Ndo wanguluta kwa wandewa wa isi yeng'ha na kuwakungajiza hamwe kwa chiwalo cha ngondo ng'hulu kuli zuwa lila lya Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />“Mkulu kangulonga! Heni ndanguya kota mhizi! Kabweda yula yalingikala meho na kuvala nguwo za heye leka yaleche kuluta mwanzi aku na kula na kudeula hali wanhu.” <verse eid="REV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Lelo, vijeni avyo naviwakungajiza awo wandewa honhu hawele nguchemigwa kwa Chiebulaniya ndo Amagedoni. <verse eid="REV 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Hamba, mhilisi wa saba nakabohola chisaye cha heye kulanga. Lizi ling'angala ihulikwa kulawa kuli chigoda cha undewa, kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi, ilonga, “Yenela!” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Nakulawila lumwemwesa na iyowe na limlungu na limachinyina liwele halinawahika kulawila Nguluwi yawalumbile wanhu muisi. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Muji ula ukulu na utuligwa honhu hadatu, najo miji ja isi yeng'ha najigwa. Babiloni, muji ula ukulu Nguluwi hausemwile, nakaunweza chizombe cha divai ya kuzudila kwa heye kukulu. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Vihilwa vyeng'ha navyuka, navyo vidunda nahavyoneche kahi. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Nhonya ya maganga makulu gawele na itunyo wa kota kilo makumi gahano chila limwe, naiwatowela wanhu. Hewo nawamliga Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha kutowa kwa nhonya ayo ya maganga. Ena, kutowa kwa nhonya ayo ya maganga nalyali ling'angala ng'hatu.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Mdala mng'hondwa na igongolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Yumwe wa wala wahilisi wa kilanga saba wawele na chisaye nakoya, kandonjela, “Uye, nani ndokulajila utaguso woyapegwe yula mdala mng'hondwa, ndo muji ula uzenjigwe hafungo ha mazi menji. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Wandewa wa isi wadita ung'hondwa hamwe na heye na wala walingikala muisi wagala divai ya ung'hondwa wa heye.”<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Hamba, londali nding'hali ndilongozwa na muhe wa Nguluwi, nandiwona ndiholigwa na mhilisi wa Nguluwi mbaka kuchiwala. Ako ndimona mdala yekalise mchanya mwa igongolo idung'hu ng'hatu. Igongolo alyo nalyali lyandichigwe chila honhu matagwa ga kumliga Nguluwi, nalyali na mitwi saba na mbalati kumi. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Mdala ayo nayali yavalile nguwo za lanji ya zambalawe na ndunghu, nayali yenolije kwa zahabu, maganga ga sendi nyinji na lulu. Mmoko wa heye nakebata chizombe cha zahabu chonachali chimemile wihe na mbuli zihile zilingulajila ung'hondwa wa heye. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Nayali yandichigwe mchihanga cha heye itagwa lya nhelo “Babiloni mng'hangala, mamo wa wang'hondwa na wa mbuli zeng'ha zihile ng'hatu muisi.” <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Ndimona ayo mdala yagalile danda ya wanhu wa Nguluwi na danda ya wanhu wabagame kwa chiwalo cha kumdamla Yesu. Vyondimuwene nambubuwala ng'hatu. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Ila mhilisi wa kilanga nakandonjela, “Lekachoni kububuwala? Heni ndokulonjela mana ivisigwe ya mdala ayo na igongolo alyo yawelengulihola liwele na mitwi saba na mbalati kumi. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Alyo igongolo lyouliwene, nalyali likomu aho mwaluko ila sambi libagama. Ahyo, lyahabehi lyokwina kulawa kuli lila ikulubila, ila lyosumigwa. Walingikala muisi wobubuwala, ena wanhu weng'ha wawele matagwa gawo hagandichigwe kuli chitabu cha ukomu kwaluchila mwaluko wa isi, wobubuwala kulyona alyo igongolo liwele aho mwaluko lichikala, hamba nalibagama na sambi lyangulawila kahi!<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />“Aha ndo luhala na nyhala vyanguganigwa kwa kuvizela vinhu avi! Avyo vitwi saba ndo vidunda saba viwele ayo mdala kangikalisa mchanya mwake. Vitwi avyo kahi ndo wandewa saba. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Hali awo wandewa saba, wahano kota ingamiya, yumwe yang'hali yolongoza na yula yunji hanafika, naye kolongoza kwa mhela udo. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Alyo igongolo liwele lyali lichikala aho mwaluko ila sambi hambe likale ndo mndewa wa nane, naye kahamwe na awo saba na kanguluta kuli kudumigwa.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />“Zila mbalati kumi zouziwene ndo wandewa wawele wang'hali kwaluka kulongoza. Ila wopegwa ludali lwa kulongoza kwa mhela wa saa imwe hamwe na alyo igongolo. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Chowogana awa kumi ndo chimwe, wolipa alyo igongolo mong'ho na ludali lwa hewo weng'ha. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Wochitowa ngondo na Mwanaing'holo, ila Mwanaing'holo hamwe na wala yawachemile na kuwahagula wawele wakitumbila, kowasumya kwa chiwalo cha heye yawele ndo Mkulu wa wakulu na Mndewa wa wandewa.”<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Muhilisi nakandonjela, “Gala mazi ugawene hala hoyekale yula mng'hondwa, ndo ikugusi lya wanhu wa chila isi na nhanzi na lukolo na ndonga. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Mbalati zila kumi zouziwene na lila igongolo womwihilwa ayo mng'hondwa. Wohola chila chinhu choyawele nacho na kumleka mwanzi, wolya miwunde ja heye na kolakazwa kwa chiluli. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Mina Nguluwi kawika mnhumbula za hewo leka wadite vyoyogana heye, wekundize hewo wawo na kumha alyo igongolo ludali lwao lwa kulongoza mbaka aho gala goyalonjile Nguluwi hogokwenela.<verse eid="REV 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />“Yula mdala yoyamuwene ndo ula muji ukulu uwele ulonjigwe kwa chiwalo cha wandewa wa isi.”<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Kugwa kwa muji wa Babiloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Hamba, nandimona mhilisi wa kilanga yunji yodulika kulawa kilanga. Nayali na ludali lukulu, nayo isi naimulikwa kwa kung'ala kwake. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Naye nakakwiniza lizi kwa iyowe, yolonga, “Kugwa, muji ukulu wa Babiloni kugwa! Lelo kuwa hakaye ha vijeni na jimazoga, kuwa hakaye ha mideje jihile na migongolo ja kuzudiza ng'hatu. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Kwa vila nhanzi zeng'ha nazigala divai ng'hali ya hegwe iwele na mong'ho ulinguwambuza kudita ung'hondwa, hewo wandewa wa isi wadita ung'hondwa hamwe na hegwe. Hewo nawaguza vinhu vya isi wana lufufu lwinji kulawa kubweda kwinji lukami kwa hegwe ne kuduma.”<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Hamba nanyhulika lizi liyage kulawa kilanga ilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:4">“Wanhu wa heni, muche kuli muji awo wa Babiloni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:4">Leka mleche kihanza kuli ung'hondwa wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:4">mleche kihanza kuli gehile ga heye.<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Mina wihe wa heye uwa winji ng'hatu, uchilunda mbaka kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:5">na Nguluwi hagasemwile gehile ga heye.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Mditileni Babiloni kota vyoyawaditileni hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:6">mumhilusile mala ya keli kwa gala goyawaditile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:6">muhanzileni mchizombe cha heye divai ng'hali mala keli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:6">Kota chakunwa choyakuwichile hegwe.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Mumhe magazo na usungu vyoilingumlapa kwa kidaya kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:7">kota ukulu na kikala kwa heye kwa kubweda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:7">Kangilonjela mnhumbula ahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:7">‘Aha ndangikala heni mndewa wa chidala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:7">Heni siwele munhu yafililwe na mlume, siwa kahi na usungu!’<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Kwa chiwalo acho nongwa za heye zomfika kwa zuwa imwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:8">utamwa na masinzo na nzala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:8">Kolakazwa na chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:8">kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi yalingumtagusa heye kana mong'ho.”<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Wandewa wa isi waditile ung'hondwa naye na kikala naye kwa kubweda wolombocheza na kulila mhela wowokona iyosi lya kulakazwa kwa heye. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Wangwima kutali kwa chiwalo cha kudumba magazo ga heye na kulonga, “Kochona! Kochona, hegwe Babiloni, muji ukulu uwele na mong'ho! Kwa mhela wa saa imwe hela utaguso wa hegwe uya.”<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Waguza vinhu wa muisi wolila na kulombocheza kwa wula muji, kwa vila kuduhuli munhu yogula kahi vinhu vya heye, <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />kuduhu kahi wakugula zahabu za heye na maganga ga sendi nyinji na vinhu vilingupulika na lulu na kitani na nguwo za lanji ya zambalau na halili na ivalo idung'hu na vinhu vya chila mbuli kuli migodi ja chiuyeng'ha na vinhu vya mbalati za nhembo na vya migodi jiwele na sendi nyinji na shaba na chuma na mabwe <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />na mdalasini na ndugwa na ubani na manemane na udi na divai na mafuta na utimbo ulinimwanimwa na ngano na isenga na ming'holo na falasi na mutuka ulingukwejigwa na lukuli na nhumbula na wapogozi wa hewo na kikala kwa wanhu.<verse eid="REV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Waguza vinhu wamlonjela Babiloni, “Mafufugo geng'ha goulolelile gajilila na lufufu na lutogo vimala, huvipata kahi!” <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Waguza vinhu wawele na lufufu lwinji kwachiwalo cha muji awo, wokwima kutali kwa chiwalo cha kudumba kwa magazo ga heye, wolila na kulombocheza, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />wolonga, “Kochona! Kochona kwa muji awu ukulu. Kuzowela kuvala mivalo ja kitani na nguwo za lanji ya zambalau na ndung'hu na kinoliga kwa zahabu na maganga ga sendi nyinji na lulu! <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Kwa saa imwe hela lufufu lwa hegwe lumala!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Hamba waligwendesa meli weng'ha na walimmajendo na wana mazi weng'ha walingukola mijito mbahali, nawema kwa kutali, <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />na vyowaliwene iyosi lya chiluli chila chilakaze, nawalila kwa lizi, “Hainalawila hetwe kuwona muji ukulu kota awu!” <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Weboholela nhimbwisi mchanya mmutwi mwa hewo wolila kwa lizi na kulombocheza, “Kochona! Kochona, hegwe muji ukulu! Wanhu weng'ha wawele na meli zilinguheluka mbahali nawapata lufufu lwinji kulawa kuli lufufu lwake. Kwa mhela wa saa imwe hela kwajiliza chila chinhu!”<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />“Usechelele hegwe kilanga, kwa chiwalo cha kuwifya kwa heye. Msechelele wanhu wa Nguluwi, vitumagwa na waloli! Mina Nguluwi kautagusa muji awo, kwa chiwalo cha mbuli yomuwaditile hemwe!”<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Hamba, mhilisi wa kilanga yumwe yawele na mong'ho nakenula iganga liwele likulu lya lwala, kalitaga mbahali yolonga, “Kwa mong'ho awo, ahi ndo Babiloni vyoyotajigwa na kwajilila ng'hatu. <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Lizi lya ching'weleng'wele na lizi lya wapemba miluli na mhalamhanda hozihulikwa kahi mgati mwa hegwe muji awo. Kuduhuli muwanzi wa mijito yoneche yila, ila yokoneka mwa hegwe kahi na lizi lya iganga lya lwala holihulikwa kahi mgati mwa hegwe. <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Lumuli lwa chenje haukoneka kahi mgati mwa hegwe, lizi lya munhu yalinguhesa na yalinguhesigwa hazihulikwa kahi mgati mwa hegwe. Waguza vinhu wa hegwe nawali wanhu wazeleche muisi na kwa uhawi wa hegwe isi zeng'ha nazajilizwa!”<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Muji awo wa Babiloni nautagusigwa kwa chiwalo cha amo koneka danda ya waloli wa Nguluwi na danda za wanhu wa Nguluwi na za wanhu weng'ha wakopoligwe muisi.<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="s">Nzimbo za kumtogola Nguluwi ako kilanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Logakwete ago, nanyhulika lizi kota lizi ng'hulu ya ikugusi lya wanhu wenji kilanga wolonga, “Yatogoligwe Nguluwi! Ugombozi na ukulu na mong'ho vyeng'ha ndo vya heye Nguluwi wa hetwe! <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Mina utaguso wa heye ndo utanganika na wa kukomya. Kamtagusa yula mng'hondwa, mkulu nayawele yayajilize isi kwa ung'hondwa wa heye. Nakamgaza kwa chiwalo cha kuwakopola vitumagwa wa heye!” <verse eid="REV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Nawalonga lwa keli, “Yatogoligwe Nguluwi! Iyosi lya chiluli chilingulakaza muji awo wokwina kilanga mazuwa gose!” <verse eid="REV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Wala wasekulu makumi meli na wane na vila vilumbigwe vikomu vine, navifunama, nawamfugamila Nguluwi yekalise mchanya mwa chigoda cha undewa, wolonga, “Ena! Yatogoligwe Nguluwi!”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mnvina ya kuhesa ya Mwanaing'holo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Hamba lizi nailawa kuli chila chigoda cha undewa, ilonga, “Mtogoleni Nguluwi hemwe vitumagwa wa heye weng'ha, hemwe mlingumdumba, wadodo kwa wakulu.” <verse eid="REV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Hamba nanyhulika lizi kota lizi ya ikugusi likulu lya wanhu na lizi lya mazi menji galingubogoma ng'hatu, ilonga, “Yatogoligwe Nguluwi! Kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi wa hetwe Yawele na Ludali kangulongoza! <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Tusangalale na kutowa luchenze, tumtogole! Kwa vila mhela wa mnvina ya kuhesa kwa Mwanaing'holo uya, na mdala yalinguhesigwa kewika goya. <verse eid="REV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Naye nakakundizwa, kuvalizwa nguwo ya kitani inojile, ilingung'hala!” Nguwo ayo ya kitani linojile ndo madito ganojile ga wanhu wa Nguluwi.<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Naye mhilisi nakandonjela, “Wandiche aga, ‘Wabweda wala walalichigwe kuli mnvina ya kuhesa ya Mwanaing'holo!’ ” Kahi nakandonjela, “Awu ndo ulonzi wa kukomya wa Nguluwi.” <verse eid="REV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Lelo, heni nhanyigwa hali magulu ga heye, nangana ndimfugamile. Ila heye kandonjela, “Leka! Heni nda chitumagwa hela kota hegwe na wang'holozo, tweng'ha twangumdamla Yesu. Ila mfugamile Nguluwi! Mina kukomya kugubuligwe na Yesu ndo ulinguwalangazila waloli.”<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Falasi mzelu na mkwinafalasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Hamba, nambona kilanga kugubuligwe, ako nakwali Falasi yumwe mzelu, naye yamkwinile, nayali yochemigwa Wakitumbila na Yatanganiche. Ndikomya, naye ndo kangutagusa na kitowa kwa chiwalo cha mbuli zigoloche. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Meho ga heye ndo kota ilapi lya chiluli na mchanya mwa mutwi wa heye namwali na vipembelo vinji. Naye kana itagwa lyandichigwe, kuduhu munhu yoneche yavizelele ila heye yuye. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Nayali yavalizwe nguwo nazilwechigwe mli danda, itagwa lya heye lyanguchemigwa “Ulonzi wa Nguluwi.” <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Wamizi wa kilanga nawamuwinza wawele wakwinile falasi wazelu na wavalile nguwo za kitani nzelu chweya. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Ipanga linoleche lyangulawa mumlomo mwake leka yawatowe wanhu wa isi zeng'ha. Naye kowadima kwa ng'hweku ya chuma na kuikama divai kuli honhu ha kukamila ha kuzudila kwa Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Naye kana itagwa lyandikwa kuli nguwo ya heye na mihaza lyake, “Mndewa wa wandewa na Mkulu wa wakulu.”<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Hamba, nandimona mhilisi wa kilanga yumwe yemile hali isanya. Nakalila kwa lizi ng'hulu, yovilonjela videje vyeng'ha vidodo vilinguguluka kilanga, “Muye! Mting'hane kwa mnvina ya Nguluwi iwele ng'hulu, <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />leka mulye miwunde ja wandewa na wakulu wa wamizi na miwunde ja wanhu wawele na mong'ho na miwunde ja falasi na ja wanhu wakwinafalasi na miwunde ja wanhu weng'ha, welejehe na wapogozi, wadodo kwa wakulu.”<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Hamba, nandilyona alila igongolo hamwe na mndewa wa isi na mwamizi wa hewo wekungazije hamwe leka wetowe ngondo na yula yonayali yekalise mchanya mwa falasi hamwe na wamizi wa heye. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Ila alyo igongolo nalibatigwa, hamwe na yula mloli wa udesi, heye yaditile vinduzanduza honhu ha heye. Kwa avyo vinduzanduza, nakawahada wanhu wala waibochele yila ndonya ya alyo igongolo, nawo hewo walifugamile limalukolo lya heye. Alyo igongolo na ayo mloli wa udesi, nawatozwa wawele wakomu kuli lila ilamba lya chiluli lilingwaka kwa maganga galingwaka. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Wamizi wa hewo nawabagama kwa ipanga lilawile kumlomo kwa yula yakwinile falasi. Mideje jeng'ha jochiguta kwa mitufi ja ng'huli za hewo.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Miyaka elufu imwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Hamba, nandimona mhilisi wa kilanga yumwe yodulika kulawa kilanga yawele na chichumulilo cha ikulubila na minyololo mikulu mmoko mwa heye. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Nakalibata lila izoka lya katali, ndo Vijeni ama Limazoga nakaliwoha na wula mnyololo kwa miyaka elufu imwe (1,000). <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Mhilisi nakalitoza kuli ikulubila na kuhinda lwizi lwa kwinjilila ako na kuwika ihota na muhuli, leka lileche kuweza kahi kwajiliza wanhu wa isi zeng'ha mbaka aho miyaka elufu imwe (1,000) hojimala. Ila hojimala miyaka ajo yomgana kudoholigwa kahi, ila kwa mhela udo hela.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Hamba nambona vigoda vya undewa na wanhu wekalise mchanya, wanhu awo nawapegwa ludali lwa kutagusa. Kahi nambona muhe wa wala wakopoligwe kwa chiwalo cha kukunda kukomya kwa Yesu na kweneza ulonzi wa Nguluwi. Awo nahawalifugamile alyo igongolo ama limalukolo lyake, ne kuwichigwa ndonya mvihanga vya hewo ama mmoko mwa hewo. Nawapegwa kahi ukomu nawalongoza kahi hamwe na Kilistu kwa miyaka elufu imwe (1,000). <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />Wala wayage wabagame hawapatile ukomu mbaka miyaka elufu imwe (1,000) genele. Awu ndo uzilipulo wa mwaluko. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Watambichizwe na kahi ndo welile hewo weng'ha wawele mli uzilipulo awu wa mwaluko. Kubagama kwa keli hakuwa na ludali hali hewo, wowa watambika wa Nguluwi na wa Kilistu, nawolongoza hamwe na heye kwa miyaka elufu imwe (1,000).<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusumigwa kwa Limazoga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Mhela miyaka elufu imwe (1,000) hojimala, Limazoga lyodoholelwa kulawa kuchinweng'ho. <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />Lelo, kolawa kunze, kokwaluka kwajiliza wanhu wa isi zeng'ha wasambaluche chila honhu muisi, wanhu awa wanguchemigwa Gogu na Magogu. Limazoga lyowakungajiza hamwe kwa chiwalo cha ngondo, nawo wowa wenji kota misanga ja kumwani. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Nawakola kuli isi yeng'ha, nawazunguluta mkambi ya wanhu wa Nguluwi na muji wa Nguluwi yalinguugana. Ila chiluli nachidulika kulawa kilanga, nakuwalakaza. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Nalyo Limazoga nalyali liwajiliza wanhu, lyotajigwa mgati mwa ilamba lilingwaka chiluli cha baluti, amo lyamumo lila igongolo na yula mloli wa udesi, nawo wogazigwa nemisi na nechilo, mazuwa gose.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utaguso wa kuduma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Hamba, nambona chigoda cha undewa chikulu chizelu, nayula yawele ngikalisa hali chigoda acho. Isi na kilanga vyajilila hali meho ga heye, nahavyoneche kahi. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Hamba, nandiwona wanhu wakulu kwa wadodo, nawema hali chigoda cha undewa na vitabu vigubuligwa. Hamba chitabu chiyage, ndo chiwele chitabu cha ukomu, nacho chogubuligwa kahi. Wabagame wogazigwa kota vyogawele madito ga hewo, kota vyoyandichigwe mgati mwa vitabu avyo. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Bahali yowalavya kunze wabagame wawele mgati mwa heye, kubagama na isi ya wabagame vyowalavya kunze wabagame wawele mgati mwake. Chila yumwe nakatagusigwa kwa gala goyaditile. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Hamba, kubagama na isi ya wabagame navitajigwa mli ilamba lya chiluli. Ilamba alyo lya chiluli ndo kubagama kwa keli. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Munhu yoneche itagwa lya heye halyandichigwe kuli chitabu cha ukomu, nakatajigwa kuli ilamba lya chiluli.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Ulanga unyale na isi inyale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Hamba, nambona ulanga unyale na isi inyale. Ulanga ula wa mwaluko na isi ila ya mwaluko navyali vipulute, nayo bahali nayali haduhuli kahi. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Ndiwona muji welile, Yelusalemu inyale, udulika kulawa kwa Nguluwi kilanga. Nawali uwichigwe goya kota mdala yahesigwe yenolije kiting'hana na mlume wa heye. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Hamba nanyulika lizi likulu kulawa kuli chigoda cha undewa ilonga, “Ulole! Hakaye ha Nguluwi ndo hamwe na wanhu. Kochikala hamwe na hewo, nawo wowa wanhu wa heye, naye kowa Nguluwi wa hewo. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Heye kobagusa mahozi ga hewo geng'ha, mina kubagama kowa kuduhuli ng'hatu na ne usungu na ne chililo na ne kutama, kwa vila vinhu vya mwaluko vipuluta!”<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Hamba yula yekalise mchigoda cha undewa nakalonga, “Ulole, ndangudita vyeng'ha viwe vinyale.” Kahi nakandonjela, “Wandiche mbuli ayi, mina ulonzi awu ndo wa kitumbila na wa kukomya!” <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Hamba nakandonjela, “Genela! Heni ndo Alufa na Omega, Mwaluko na Kuduma. Yawele na ng'halu ndompa chinhu cha kunwa kulawa kuli nzasa ya mazi ga ukomu ne kulavya sendi. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Heye yoneche yalingusumya aga, kobochela acho, nani ndowa Nguluwi wa heye naye kowa mwanangu. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Ila wanhu walingudumba na wohambe wakunde na walihela luhala na walingukopola na wang'hondwa na wahawi na walingufugamila jimalukolo na wadesi weng'ha honhu ha hewo howa mgati mwa lila ilamba lilingwaka chiluli na baluti, ako ndo kubagama kwa keli.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelusalemu inyale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Hamba yumwe wa wala wahilisi wa kilanga saba wawele na vila visaye saba navimemile nongwa saba za kuduma, nakoya na kundonjela, “Uye! Nani ndokulajila mdala yahesigwe mche wa Mwanaing'holo!” <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Lelo, Muhe Yelile naumema kwa heni, naye mhilisi kanyhilika mchanya mwa chidunda chikulu ng'hatu chiling'wemang'wema. Kandajila muji welile wa Yelusalemu, udulika kulawa kwa Nguluwi kilanga, <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />upulika kwa ukulu wa Nguluwi. Kupulika kwake nakwali kota iganga lya sendi nyinji kota vila yasipi ilingupulika kota chilolelo. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Nawali na lukanzi lulefu na lukulu luzungulute muji awo, luwele na lwizi migazi kumi na mbili, chila lumwe na lwimililwa na mhilisi wa kilanga. Mchanya mwa chila lwizi nahandichigwa limwe lya matagwa ga nhanzi kumi na mbili za Isilaeli. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Kwali na lwizi migazi midatu, ubanzi wolilawila isanya lwizi migazi jidatu na kaskazini lwizi migazi jidatu na kusini lwizi migazi jidatu na kolizinjila isanya lwizi migazi jidatu. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Lukanzi lwa muji awo lwali luzenjigwe mchanya mwa maganga ga msisi kumi na meli, mchanya mwa chila iganga nahali handichigwe itagwa limwe lya wala vitumagwa kumi na weli wa Mwanaing'holo.<verse eid="REV 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Ila yula mhilisi yalonjile na heni nayali na ng'hweku ya zahabu leka yaupime muji awo na lwizi lugazi lwa heye na lukanzi lwa heye. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Muji awo nawali na banzi zine zilingiwhana, ung'wemang'wema na ugazi nawiwhana. Lelo, mhilisi nakaupima muji awo kwa ng'hweku ya heye, nawali na ung'wemang'wema wiwhanile na ugazi na wiwhanile kuza kuchanya, kota kilomita elufu mbili na miya zine (2,400). <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Hamba nakaupima lukanzi lwa heye, lwali na ugazi wa mita makumi sita (60) kwa chipimilo cha meho ga chiwunhu, ndo chiwele mhilisi wa kilanga chonayapimile. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Lukanzi alo nalwali luzenjigwe kwa maganga madung'hu ga sendi nyinji, muji wuwo nawali uzenjigwe kwa zahabu inojile, ilingung'hala kota chilolelo. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Maganga ga msisi wa lukanzi awo nagali ganolijigwe kwa chila iganga lya sendi nyinji. Iganga lya mwaluko lya msisi nalyali iganga lya sendi nyinji lidung'hu na lya keli lya yakuti samawati na lya kadatu kalikedoni na lya kane zumalidi <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />na lya kahano salidoniki na lya sita akiki na lya saba kilisolito na lya nane zubalajadi na lya tisa topazi na lya kumi kilisopilaso na lya kumi na imwe yasintho na lya kumi na mbili ametisto. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Jila lwizi migazi kumi na mbili najali na lulu kumi na mbili na chila lwizi lugongomanywa kwa lulu imwe. Chila nzila ng'hulu ya muji naigongomanywa kwa zahabu inojile, ilingupulika kota chilolelo.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Siwene Ng'handa ya Nguluwi kuli muji awo, mina Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali na yula Mwanaing'holo ndo ng'handa ya Nguluwi ya muji awo. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Muji awo hambe ulape isanya ne nyelezi kuung'alichila, mina ukulu wa Nguluwi wanguung'alichila na Mwanaing'holo ndo lumuli lwa muji awo. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Wanhu wa isi wochikala kuli lumuli lwake na wandewa wa isi wougalila lufufu lwa hewo. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Lwizi migazi ja muji awo jowa jichumuligwe nemisi yeng'ha, kwa vila hakuwa na nechilo amo. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Wanhu wa isi zeng'ha wougalila muji awo, ukulu na lufufu lwa isi. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Ila kuduhuli chinhu choneche chiwele chikokomoche chikwinjila amo, ne munhu yoneche yodita mbuli ya kuzudiza ama ya udesi hokwinjila amo. Ndo wala hela wandichigwe kuli chitabu cha ukomu cha Mwanaing'holo ndo wokwinjila kuli muji awo.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="s">Lwanda lwa mazi galingigala ukomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Hamba yula mhilisi nakandajila lwanda lwa mazi galingigala ukomu galingupulika kota chilolelo, golawila mchigoda cha undewa cha Nguluwi na cha Mwanaing'holo. <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />Lwanda alo naluloka hagati ha muji. Hafungo ha lwanda alo nakwali na igodi lya ukomu lilingulela mafuza mala kumi na mbili kwa mwaka, iwele ndo mala imwe chila mwezi, mahamba ga alyo igodi ndo mikwandi ja kuwateleka wanhu wa isi zeng'ha. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Haduhuli chinhu choneche chipanjilwe na Nguluwi chowa kuli muji awo. Chigoda cha undewa cha Nguluwi na cha Mwanaing'holo chowa kuli muji awo na vitumagwa wa heye womfugamila. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Wochiwona naye meho kwa meho na itagwa lya heye lyokwandikwa mli vihanga vya hewo. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Nechilo kowa kuduhuli kahi, ne howolapa lumuli lwa chenje ama lwa isanya kahi, mina Mkulu Nguluwi kowamwemwesela, nawo wolongoza kota wandewa mazuwa gose.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuya kahi kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Hamba mhilisi wa kilanga nakandonjela, “Ulonzi awo ndo wa kukomya na wa kitumbila. Mkulu Nguluwi yawelenguwapa waloli walonje usenga wa heye kwa Muhe wa heye, nakamlajiza mhilisi wa heye yawalajile watumigwa wa heye mbuli ziwele zolawila sambi baha.”<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />“Uhulichize!” “Ndanguya himahima. Kobweda yula yalingibatilila mbuli za uloli ziwele kuli chitabu achi.”<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Heni Yohana, nandizona na kuzihulika mbuli azi. Vyonanyuliche na kona, nanyigwa hali magulu ga ayo mhilisi wa kilanga yandajile mbuli azi, nangana kumfugamila. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Ila heye nakandonjela, “Leka kudita ahyo! Heni nda chitumagwa hela kota hegwe na wang'holozo waloli na weng'ha wawele nguhulichiza malajizo gawele muli chitabu achi. Mumfugamile Nguluwi!” <verse eid="REV 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Kahi kandonjela, “Uleche kudita kota uviso mbuli ya uloli iwele muli chitabu achi, mina mhela wa kulawila kwa ago wahabehi. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Wanhu walingudita wihe na walutilile kudita wihe, yula yawele yakokomoche yalutilile kuwa yakokomoche. Yawele ngudita ganojile nayalutilile kudita ganojile, yula yawele yelile nayalutilile kuwa yelile.”<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />Yesu kangulonga, “Muhulichize! Ndanguya himahima hamwe na igano lyondimpa chila yumwe kulawa kuli madito ga heye. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Heni ndo Alufa na Omega, wa mwaluko na wa kuduma. Wamwaluko na wa kuduma kwa chila chinhu.”<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Wabweda wala walinguhovuga nguwo za hewo, wawe na hachi ya kulya ifuza lya igodi lilingigala ukomu na ludali lwa kwinjila kuli lwizi migazi ja muji. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Ila mibwa na wahawi na wang'hondwa na walingukopola na walingufugamila jimalukolo na weng'ha walingugana kulonga udesi, wochikala kunze kwa muji.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />“Heni, Yesu, ndimlajiza mhilisi wa kilanga yawalonjele mbuli ayi kuli vilundo vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu. Heni nda lulelo lwa lukolo lwa Daudi. Heni ndo nhondwe ilingupulika lufuku!”<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Muhe wa Nguluwi na mdala yalinguhesigwa, wangulonga, “Uye!” Chila munhu yalinguhulika ali, nayalonje, “Uye!” Yawele na ng'halu yoye na yalingugana mazi ga ukomu yahole ne kulavya sendi.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulonzi wa kugwisa chilasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Heni ndanguwakanya weng'ha walinguhulika mbuli za uloli uwele kuli chitabu achi, munhu yoneche yokonjeza choneche kuli mbuli ayo, Nguluwi komonjezela nongwa zandichigwe kuli chitabu achi. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Munhu yoneche yopungula choneche kuli ulonzi wa uloli uwele kuli chitabu achi, Nguluwi komsukula honhu ha heye kuli lila igodi lya ukomu na honhu ha heye kuli muji welile, uwele ulonjigwe kuli chitabu achi. <verse eid="REV 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Yesu yalingulavya kukomya kwa heye kuli mbuli ayi kangulonga, “Ndangukomya ndanguya himahima.” Ena. Uye Mkulu Yesu! <verse eid="REV 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Ndanguwaganilani wanhu weng'ha wa Nguluwi isungu lya Mkulu Yesu. Ena.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>